{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HGELroYUycxz86ZE852wRa","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Issue 5: Chainsaw rule\n2\t\n3\t## Outcome\n4\t\n5\tOnly members who passed the induction for a class-C tool (the chainsaw is class C) can borrow it.\n6\tEveryone else is told why they cannot.\n7\t\n8\t## Requirements\n9\t\n10\t- When a member whose inductions do not include \"C\" asks to borrow a class-C item, the system shall refuse with `ok: false`.\n11\t- When a member whose inductions include \"C\" asks to borrow a class-C item that is in, the system shall allow it.\n12\t- If a class-C item is refused for a missing induction, the system shall give a reason that names the item.\n13\t- Where an item is class A or class B, the system shall not require any induction.\n14\t- While a class-C item is in repair or out, the system shall refuse it even for an inducted member.\n15\t\n16\t## Must not change\n17\t\n18\t- `src/auth/` is not edited.\n19\t- The existing refusals for items in repair or already out keep their reasons.\n20\t- A free class-A tool still goes out to a member with no inductions.\n21\t- Money handling (deposits are integer cents) is untouched.\n22\t\n23\t## Out of scope\n24\t\n25\t- Recording or granting inductions, and the desk or server screens.\n26\t- Inductions for classes other than C, and any other item rules.\n27\t- Changes to the seed data.\n28\t\n29\t## Done when\n30\t\n31\t- The new tests in `tests/items/borrow.test.ts` pass.\n32\t- `bun run gate` exits 0.\n33\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d20fb6a9-b9db-419b-9f89-e0a198d29510","uuid":"307036dd-a94d-4f7e-bd10-942176d308af","timestamp":"2026-11-14T16:32:22.727Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/user/software-factory-claude-code/parts/06-price-and-ship/03-ship-the-factory/solution/rerun/runs/5/repo/specs/5/SPEC.md","content":"# Issue 5: Chainsaw rule\n\n## Outcome\n\nOnly members who passed the induction for a class-C tool (the chainsaw is class C) can borrow it.\nEveryone else is told why they cannot.\n\n## Requirements\n\n- When a member whose inductions do not include \"C\" asks to borrow a class-C item, the system shall refuse with `ok: false`.\n- When a member whose inductions include \"C\" asks to borrow a class-C item that is in, the system shall allow it.\n- If a class-C item is refused for a missing induction, the system shall give a reason that names the item.\n- Where an item is class A or class B, the system shall not require any induction.\n- While a class-C item is in repair or out, the system shall refuse it even for an inducted member.\n\n## Must not change\n\n- `src/auth/` is not edited.\n- The existing refusals for items in repair or already out keep their reasons.\n- A free class-A tool still goes out to a member with no inductions.\n- Money handling (deposits are integer cents) is untouched.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Recording or granting inductions, and the desk or server screens.\n- Inductions for classes other than C, and any other item rules.\n- Changes to the seed data.\n\n## Done when\n\n- The new tests in `tests/items/borrow.test.ts` pass.\n- `bun run gate` exits 0.\n","numLines":33,"startLine":1,"totalLines":33}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HGELroYUycxz86ZE852wRa","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
